{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zeJptL6wQ81793023041.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國歌手CHRIS BROWN就3年前倫敦一宗夜店打鬥，被判緩刑8個月。</p><p></p><p>他離開倫敦的法庭時戴上口罩，有歌迷為他毋須即時監禁歡呼。案情指37歲的格林美獎得主歌手CHRIS BROWN於2023年2月在倫敦一間夜店打鬥，用酒樽打一名音樂監製的頭，過程被閉路電視拍下，而當時現場有很多人。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.UK.SINGER-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RxFHlR8GBc1793023050.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>CHRIS BROWN案發後離開了英國，去年到英國開演唱會時被捕，獲准以500萬英鎊，折合約5,200萬港元保釋。</p><p></p><p>他於7月承認一項公眾地方打鬥罪，換取控方撤銷襲擊，企圖造成嚴重身體傷害，及管有攻擊性武器的控罪。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:09.397319+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:58:15.093133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:15.995132+00:00","content_hash":"4bc123b79db78900a90e124ab65dfc058c7573c7148328de432f5de8dbd6e396","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:09.397319+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}